            "sid": "JUD 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagonzibwa, habw'ekihika kingi eki mbaire nakyo eky'okubahandiikira ebirukukwata ha kujunwa kwaitu, ndozire nikyetaagwa muno okubahandiikira nimbateererra: murwanirre enyikiriza abantu ba Ruhanga ei baahairwe omurundi gumu, kyahwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba haroho abantu abamu abaatutaahiremu tutarukumanya. Nubo abo abaarangirweho ira nkooku balisingwa omusango. Bali bantu abatatiina Ruhanga, abahindura embabazi za Ruhanga waitu nibaifoora byekwaso by'okukora eby'obusiihani, baayanga Omulemi waitu omu wenka kandi MUKAMA Yesu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ababahabisa balifubirwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
