                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balikibona! Habwokuba bakwasire omuhanda gwa Kaini, beenaga omu nsobi eya Balaamu habw'okwetungira amagoba, kandi bahwerekererra omu bwemi bwa Koora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubo abo abasiisa amagenyi ganyu ag'engonzi habwokuba bakora ebintu bya buli mulingo bataina nsoni, nibeefaaho bonka. Bali nk'ebicu ebitarumu njura, ebirukutwarwa omuyaga; rundi nk'emiti etaana bijuma omu kasumi kaabyo, eyafiire yaleka, kandi yasindukira kimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bali nk'ebigonzi by'enyanja erukusikuka, nibarugwamu esaabu n'orwondo. Bali nk'enyunyuuzi ezirukwenjeera, abaayahuliirwe okwikara omu mwirima kasira ebiro byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
